

Tekst ved: ['html'] gør: { <- (
		selv
		erstat: ['&'] med: ['&amp;'],
		erstat: ['<'] med: ['&lt;'],
		erstat: ['>'] med: ['&gt;'],
		erstat: ['"'] med: ['&quot;']
	).
}.


Uddata skriv: ([' left trimmed '] trim) + [' '] + ( ['and right trimmed'] trim) + ['!'], stop.
Uddata skriv: ['<html>"html & entities"</html>'] html.
